{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>無論是長途自駕、山徑遠足還是城市單車漫遊，《GPS Travel Journal》都能把每一段路程化成可重溫的記錄。它同時兼備導航與行程記憶功能，適合熱愛戶外探索的人，也適合日常通勤需要快速找到熟悉地點的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>地圖留痕記錄足跡</h2>\n<p>應用可將喜愛的地點連同筆記與相片一併儲存，逐步累積成圖文並茂的旅行日誌，並在地圖上留下點點軌跡，重現每一段行程的路線。用家可為餐廳、商店或公園加入書籤，一按即取得前往該處的指示，亦能記錄泊車位置。行程期間會顯示距離、時間、速度及燃料成本等即時數據，並支援離線追蹤，無須連接互聯網。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-265-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-266-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-267-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-268-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-269-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-270-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：GPS Travel Journal</li>\n<li>應用類別：Navigation</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-14T14:19:47.046632+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":329,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}